      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Folio 2r, right side (second section)",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>\n<p>&ldquo;[We are the... of the Go]d of hea[ven, and the books that are?]</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>in our hand&nbsp;are (books) of healing.&rdquo; [He answered]</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>and said to them: &ldquo;What healing [is in them?]&rdquo;</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>They said to him: &ldquo;Every healing that our master wishes.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>And also a woman who is barren, who did not give birth&mdash;</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>we can give her a child without (intercourse with) a man.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>When Caesar heard (this), he made fun of them.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>He said to them: &ldquo;I have a daughter, a virgin&mdash;</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>can you grant her children without (intercourse with) a man?&rdquo; [ ... ... ]</p>\n</li></ol>\n",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
      "motivation": [
        "sc:supplementing",
        "translating"
      ],
      "schema:position": 1
    },
