      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Folio 2r, left side (third section)",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>\n<p>&ldquo;... &lsquo;[ ... ] on the cr[oss&rsquo; and he said] to the people whom he [misled],</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>&ldquo;If you come tomorrow, and do not</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>f[in]d my body&mdash;know that I ascended to Heaven.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Now, if our master wishes, I will bring him</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>and will show his body.&rdquo; He said to him (i.e., Yehudah): &ldquo;Go and bring him out.&rdquo;</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Yehudah the gardener went and took him out, and dragged</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>him in the streets of Tiberias, and proclaimed and said: &ldquo;This is</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Yeshu, son of Pandera, who rebelled against the great God who is</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>in Heaven.&rdquo; He brought him before the king, and he summoned [ ... ]</p>\n</li></ol>\n",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
      "motivation": [
